    "summary": "In this post, we walk through how to get started with MiniMax models on Amazon Bedrock, including the capabilities supported by these models, the service tiers available, how on-demand inference scales to handle your workloads, and the different APIs you can use to access them. Using these models, customers can build agentic applications, long-context document analysis pipelines, and software engineering workflows, all backed by the security and operational guarantees of AWS.",
