    "summary": "In this post, you deploy a two-phase infrastructure for multi-turn RL using Amazon Nova Forge on Amazon SageMaker HyperPod. By the end, you have an event-driven pipeline that starts training when you upload data to Amazon Simple Storage Service (Amazon S3). The training job teaches the model to play Wordle, a placeholder for your own RL task.",
